            <ArticleTitle>The use of Silflex in burn wound management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S32-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article presents three case studies looking at the effective use of an atraumatic wound dressing: Silflex (Advancis Medical). Pain is known to be very debilitating in patients with burns and frequent dressing changes can pose a painful problem. The case studies, presented here, support the view that Silflex, a silicone-based conformable dressing, is a useful adjunct when treating superficial burns.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
